  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would condemn knowingly reporting a self-caused break as damage on arrival, and would favor telling the seller the truth and repairing the loss where possible. They may differ over how much a badly designed form mitigates the user's blame or changes the practical remedy; the dialogue does not establish that such a form was used.",
